"App 不把 CPA 管理密钥写入普通偏好设置；部署生成的密钥仍由 Keychain 保存。修改后 CPAMP 会先验证连接再保存。" = "Apps do not write CPA management keys to normal preferences; deployment-generated keys are still held by Keychain. After modification, CPAMP will verify the connection before saving.";
"App 仅创建 OAuth 会话、打开授权页、轮询状态和按需转交回调地址。授权令牌不会写入 App 偏好设置或日志；插件与当前目标 CLIProxyAPI 决定凭证的实际存储位置。" = "The app simply creates an OAuth session, opens the authorization page, polls for status, and forwards the callback address as needed. Authorization tokens are not written to App preferences or logs; the plugin and the current target CLIProxyAPI determine where the credentials are actually stored.";
"App 会使用目标目录中最近的 backups/upgrade-*，恢复上一版启动脚本并重新验证 %@。不会删除认证文件或 CPAMP 数据。" = "The app will use the latest backups/upgrade-* in the target directory to restore the previous startup scripts and re-verify %@. Credential files and CPAMP data are not deleted.";
"App 会停止当前目标服务并删除本机保存的 CPA / CPAMP 管理密钥，但不会删除目标目录、认证文件或远程部署文件。之后可以选择另一个本机或 VPS 目标。" = "The app will stop the current target service and delete the locally saved CPA/CPAMP management keys, but will not delete the target directory, certification files, or remote deployment files. You can then choose another local or VPS destination.";
"App 会先保存当前启动脚本和运行时到目标目录的 backups/upgrade-*，再下载官方最新 CLIProxyAPI 与 CPA Manager Plus。配置、认证文件和 CPAMP 数据会保留。" = "The App will first save the current startup script and runtime to backups/upgrade-* in the target directory, and then download the latest official CLIProxyAPI and CPA Manager Plus. Configuration, authentication files, and CPAMP data are preserved.";
"App 会先停止由本次部署创建的进程或 Compose 服务，再把失败部署文件和日志移动到目标目录的 backups/failed-*，不会直接删除。" = "The App will first stop the process or Compose service created by this deployment, and then move the failed deployment files and logs to backups/failed-* in the target directory, and will not delete them directly.";
"App 只显示 CLIProxyAPI 返回的脱敏运行日志；如需完整请求错误文件、下载或按请求查看证据，请打开同一目标的 CPAMP 面板。" = "The app only displays the masked run log returned by CLIProxyAPI; if you want to fully request the error file, download or view the evidence upon request, please open the CPAMP panel of the same target.";
"App 已记录授权失败原因。请回到 Oases CPA 查看并重新开始。" = "The App has recorded the reason for authorization failure. Please go back to Oases CPA to review and start over.";
"App 正在确认 CLIProxyAPI、CPAMP 和 SSH 隧道状态" = "App is confirming CLIProxyAPI, CPAMP and SSH tunnel status";
"App 直接调用当前目标的 CLIProxyAPI 管理接口" = "App directly calls the CLIProxyAPI management interface of the current target";
"App 通过 CLIProxyAPI 的管理 API 代理额度请求，按 auth_index 选择凭证；明文 token 留在目标环境内。cooldown 则直接读取 CPAMP 的 usage service。" = "The App proxy quota request through the management API of CLIProxyAPI, and select the credentials according to auth_index; the clear text token remains in the target environment. cooldown directly reads the usage service of CPAMP.";
"App 默认按 models.dev、LiteLLM、OpenRouter 的顺序为已配置或已调用模型补充公开价格。新模型会尽快同步，既有价格每天更新一次；网络失败时保留最近一次可用价格。手动价格只用于特殊别名或内部模型。" = "By default, the App supplements the public prices for configured or called models in the order of models.dev, LiteLLM, and OpenRouter. New models will be synchronized as soon as possible, and existing prices will be updated once a day; in the event of network failure, the latest available price will be retained. Manual pricing is only available for special aliases or internal models.";
