"这只会清空当前目标 CLIProxyAPI 的运行日志，不会删除认证文件、配置或部署目录。" = "This will only clear the run log of the current target CLIProxyAPI and will not delete the authentication files, configuration or deployment directories.";
"这只删除 CPAMP 本地成本估算条目，不会停用认证文件、修改 Provider、删除请求历史或改变实际账单。" = "This only removes the CPAMP local cost estimate entry and does not deactivate the certification file, modify the provider, delete the request history, or change the actual bill.";
