"这里会承接 OpenRouter、GitHub Copilot 等第三方授权流程，并把凭证写入对应 Provider。" = "This will take over third-party authorization processes such as OpenRouter and GitHub Copilot, and write the credentials to the corresponding Provider.";
"这里会承接 config.yaml 的可视化编辑、Diff、重启策略以及未保存变更保护。" = "This will take over the visual editing, Diff, restart strategy and unsaved change protection of config.yaml.";
"这里会承接插件资源、插件页面和 OAuth 能力，保留 CPAMP 的扩展边界。" = "Plug-in resources, plug-in pages and OAuth capabilities will be taken over here, and the extension boundaries of CPAMP will be retained.";
